  "body": "<div data-page-id=\"doxcnBiK7hW90o9lYZkJFwMLOXd\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnasyYiMISi0wW6csSmuqvWg\">The Status Bar is a useful tool at the bottom of NeoReader to display information, including time, battery value, remaining reading time, reading progress, and chapter name during reading.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnQs8K2isEKk2Cs4xWriWZE1\"><img src=\"https://booxsupport.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/40685997036692\" alt=\"10-1.png\"></div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-doxcnkuska84iMIsGwPtmiD5gqe\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json='{\"items\":[{\"uuid\":\"f5268546-338d-47c5-a59c-37da983244f7\",\"height\":800,\"width\":960,\"currHeight\":800,\"currWidth\":960,\"natrualHeight\":800,\"natrualWidth\":960,\"pluginName\":\"imageUpload\",\"scale\":1,\"src\":\"https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2Fboxcn6nDpETqr0sRpJ1jfXOZbwb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16\",\"file_token\":\"boxcn6nDpETqr0sRpJ1jfXOZbwb\",\"image_type\":\"image/jpeg\",\"size\":234850,\"comments\":[]}]}'> </div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnesk8wqWk6uI4W6db8H72ih\"> </div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnkIqKWCA6EIUCcMC7SibLEc\">To enable/disable or customize the Status Bar, do the following:</div>\n<ol>\n<li>Tap any book file in the <strong>Library</strong> to open <strong>NeoReader</strong>.</li>\n<li>Tap the center area to display the main menu.</li>\n<li>Tap the More icon in the top right corner and choose <strong>Settings</strong> &gt;<strong> Global Settings</strong>.</li>\n<li>Toggle \"<strong>Enable Reading Status Bar</strong>\" and the settings below.</li>\n<li>Drag to adjust the section order or tap to select which section is shown on the bar.</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n<p> </p>"
